    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Theme song sung by Marn\u00e9e Richardson, written/produced by Elvisish.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Bryce Tiles: The Isometric Push-Puzzler! Check it:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Think <strong>Rescue Rover</strong>, <strong>Bolo Adventures</strong>, <strong>Puzzle Pits</strong>, <strong>Adventures of Lolo</strong> and <strong>Capt'n Squiddy's Bootleg Push-Push</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong><i>100</i></strong> main campaign levels, <strong>30</strong> additional mission levels <i>plus</i> <strong>secret world levels and endings</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Cute, anti-heroic protagonist with an adorably utilitarian personality!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Original</strong> ambient virtual-analog synthesizer soundtrack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Super slick gameplay on Windows! Modern graphical slickness and smooth 165fps+ motion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Occasional pop culture references to nineties gaming and music!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Dozens of <strong>Sokoban</strong>-style mechanics and gameplay designs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 10+ unique <strong>enemies</strong> lurking throughout the game!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Occasional novelty level structures! Pathfinding enemies! Environmental effects!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Localization support for 12 languages!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Full level-editor, campaign maker and Steam<strong>\u2122</strong> Workshop<strong>\u00ae</strong> uploader included!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Secret worlds, hidden gameplay modes, final bosses and alternative endings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/extras/6ef9f7b38d08c2fcfc12253b2dc8dd50.poster.avif?t=1753221538\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/extras/6ef9f7b38d08c2fcfc12253b2dc8dd50.webm?t=1753221538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/extras/6ef9f7b38d08c2fcfc12253b2dc8dd50.mp4?t=1753221538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>E</strong>ver wanted to <strong>push</strong>, <i>push</i>, <u>push </u>your way to success? Feelin' a little desperate to glide into position? Movin', groovin' and cruisin' through an isometric tile-space of colorful, pre-rendered visuals and cool-toon characters? Look no further, <i><strong>Bryce Tiles</strong></i> is here! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/extras/5eddb59cfcbeb842d59bf297006f73ad.avif?t=1753221538\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be prepared for a box-pushing time! Bryce Tiles is a post- MSDOSWare game set in the early 00's! Bryce has discovered a new time portal in his Klik 'N' Complete Box and has used it once more to return to 25 years ago, when EuroMaxi K&amp;C was shared by Nash!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In an entirely isometric Meiersian world, he pushes, slides, swims, flees, rolls and collects the missing instruments around more than 130 levels of nostalgic sokoban action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just take your little man and push him around... seriously, it's never been easier! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/extras/0f54fc0f6a0a8d5c0a0d92fcb38b056d.poster.avif?t=1753221538\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/extras/0f54fc0f6a0a8d5c0a0d92fcb38b056d.webm?t=1753221538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/extras/0f54fc0f6a0a8d5c0a0d92fcb38b056d.mp4?t=1753221538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Up, down, left, right, hit all those hard-to-reach spots (not diagonally though!) and make it out of the level as fast as you can... or in as few amount as pushes! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/extras/57d254a4443cb009e0cf942e000d4ba3.avif?t=1753221538\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll encounter sinking sands, still (but deep!) waters, dangerously fast rapids, moving floors, slidey ice and burning hot coals as you push those boxes around! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/extras/c78563594f82a78fb0b97af7ef8fb9e7.poster.avif?t=1753221538\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/extras/c78563594f82a78fb0b97af7ef8fb9e7.webm?t=1753221538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/extras/c78563594f82a78fb0b97af7ef8fb9e7.mp4?t=1753221538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plan ahead and determine which pushable object is most suitable for the environment! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/extras/fa1307031bbb496416d6dc1216241210.avif?t=1753221538\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rolling balls (hint: they don't stop by themselves!), Scrump The Ruff\u2122, laser beams (with mirrors to reflect them... yes, we know where you saw them first!)... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/extras/5c4f483213cd19673cbcc066a7f7b0d1.poster.avif?t=1753221538\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/extras/5c4f483213cd19673cbcc066a7f7b0d1.webm?t=1753221538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/extras/5c4f483213cd19673cbcc066a7f7b0d1.mp4?t=1753221538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">...locked doors, push-pads, it's all there to try and confuse you... but you'll stay one step ahead!   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/extras/a7a6b37e9139455ee191f68049645705.avif?t=1753221538\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plenty of tricks and traps to keep you busy, challenging puzzle designs and beautifully pre-rendered surroundings to keep you entertained for hours! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/extras/30ef776be0647245bf18b62f1455b550.poster.avif?t=1753221538\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/extras/30ef776be0647245bf18b62f1455b550.webm?t=1753221538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/extras/30ef776be0647245bf18b62f1455b550.mp4?t=1753221538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There's only one Bryce Tiles!\u00a0\u2193\u2193\u2193</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/extras/0ef8e2f8645dddfa1511262fa03a6ce0.avif?t=1753221538\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>(Theme song sung by Marn\u00e9e Richardson  and\u00a0written and produced by Elvisish. NOT A.I. </i><br><br><br><br><i>Absolutely no AI was used in the creation of Bryce Tiles, its theme/game music, art or any other part of the game.)</i></p>",
