ss=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144990/extras/0ef8e2f8645dddfa1511262fa03a6ce0.avif?t=1753221538\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>(Theme song sung by Marn\u00e9e Richardson  and\u00a0written and produced by Elvisish. NOT A.I. </i><br><br><br><br><i>Absolutely no AI was used in the creation of Bryce Tiles, its theme/game music, art or any other part of the game.)</i></p>",
